Please try making all types in your nimbleFunction doubles.

E.g. z.init = double(1) instead of z.init = integer(1)

On Tue, Feb 21, 2023 at 2:01 PM Debbie Shackleton <dmshac...@gmail.com> wrote:

> Hi All,
>
